# Scene2-1-22

; ========================================
; ●シーン2‐1-22
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:1_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_32_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:审判结束后，<br>我来到了玛格的房间。|#0201Adv27_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我很在意玛格提到过的，可可留下的语音备忘录。<br>想再检查看看这里还有没有其他线索。|#0201Adv27_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在这座监牢中度过的数日间，<br>这里没有留下任何她存在过的痕迹。|#0201Adv27_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这是一个有些冷清的房间。|#0201Adv27_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（不知为何。<br>　我总觉得她像是会给房间添上更多装饰的人）|#0201Adv27_Hiro001|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（……话说回来，没有线索啊。<br>　明天直接去问可可应该更快）|#0201Adv27_Hiro002|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:老实说还有一个原因。搜查有些难以进行了。|#0201Adv27_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为我刚进这个房间，<br>艾玛就跟着进来了。|#0201Adv27_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛似乎是在<br>寻找玛格的遗物。|#0201Adv27_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Cry1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:呜呜……玛格……|#0201Adv27_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:她眼里噙着泪水，<br>在玛格的床边翻找着。|#0201Adv27_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（真是一厢情愿的感伤之举。<br>　对于玛格——那个魔女……根本就没有半点同情的余地）|#0201Adv27_Hiro003|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（她是个犯下杀人罪，甚至不惜陷害我，<br>　只为逃避罪责的卑鄙小人）|#0201Adv27_Hiro004|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（口口声声说着【爱】，<br>　实际不过是自私地杀害了梅露露罢了）|#0201Adv27_Hiro005|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我是这么想的。<br>我明明是这么想的……但不知为何，<br>我的拳头一直在颤抖。|#0201Adv27_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就像在强忍着什么一样。|#0201Adv27_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:理所当然地，<br>我和艾玛没有对话。|#0201Adv27_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:正当我准备离开<br>这尴尬的空间时。|#0201Adv27_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0201Adv27_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我用余光瞥见艾玛似乎发现了什么东西，<br>然后迅速将它藏进了怀里。|#0201Adv27_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（她藏了什么……？）|#0201Adv27_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这让我非常在意，<br>于是我转向了艾玛。|#0201Adv27_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:我要走了，<br>你还打算继续找下去？|#0201Adv27_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，嗯。<br>我想再看看有没有别的东西——|#0201Adv27_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露死了，<br>玛格被处刑了，<br>你会为此感到伤心吗？|#0201Adv27_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这……当然难过啊。<br>或许她们两人确实都做了不可饶恕的事。|#0201Adv27_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Cry1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:但对我来说，只要有人不在了，<br>我就会觉得悲伤、觉得寂寞……|#0201Adv27_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:乍看之下，<br>艾玛似乎是真情流露。|#0201Adv27_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然而，面对泪流满面的艾玛。|#0201Adv27_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我脑海中浮现的是，<br>那段和艾玛亲密无间的时光——|#0201Adv27_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

