@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:"（不只是这次。<br>　类似的事发生过好多次）|#0201Adv27_Hiro012|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（正因为相处时间长，我才明白。<br>　艾玛绝不是大家以为的“好孩子”）|#0201Adv27_Hiro013|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（她曾冷眼旁观小雪被霸凌，<br>　对她见死不救，这便是证据）|#0201Adv27_Hiro014|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（艾玛，是邪恶的）|#0201Adv27_Hiro015| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

