@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:上初中以后，<br>月代雪加入了我们——|#0201Adv27_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:有一次，趁艾玛不在时，<br>她悄悄在我耳边低语。|#0201Adv27_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛她啊，<br>总有一天会成为带来灾祸的魔女哦。|#0201Adv27_Yuki001| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她会杀死很多人。|#0201Adv27_Yuki002| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:会让大家都变得不幸。|#0201Adv27_Yuki003| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:很可怕吧。<br>那一天终将到来。|#0201Adv27_Yuki004| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

