@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#00000000 Duration:1 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:小雪总是喜欢用转弯抹角的说法，<br>所以当时我以为是某种隐喻。|#0201Adv27_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但现在我明白了。|#0201Adv27_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我应该制裁的恶——【魔女】，<br>　就在我的眼前）|#0201Adv27_Hiro016|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（为了避免发生更大的悲剧，<br>　我必须负起责任纠正你）|#0201Adv27_Hiro017|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（如果你就是不该存在于这个世界的魔女，<br>　那么——就由我来杀死你）|#0201Adv27_Hiro018|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（这就是我必须完成的使命）|#0201Adv27_Hiro019| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:原以为已经成功压抑的黑暗，<br>正在悄然渗出，逐渐膨胀。|#0201Adv27_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我满怀冰冷的杀意，<br>久久注视着艾玛的背影。|#0201Adv27_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

